{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "7017fa90a0c33def2c27c93f719e12b7e42f93c619312ca2906af8cace18ccaf", "ja": "運命の糸でつながった君たちへ", "zh": "致由命运之线相连的你们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "10dc6754517466354fd18eb97817da4ffb869a16ef3dc10a12f3d349eda48c57", "ja": "公開収録当日。ライブパートでテーマソング\nを披露し大成功に終わる。「出会ってくれて\nありがとう」の気持ちを伝えられたと信じて\n3人はそのままおまけ番組にもなる打ち上げ\nに向かうのだった。", "zh": "公开录制当天。在演出环节\n表演主题曲并大获成功。相信已经传达了\n“谢谢你与我相遇”的心情，3人就这样前往了\n还将作为特别节目的庆功宴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1027_null", "source_sha256": "fd852ce898324c5d4d6ef68e4e915d65208d2eb4354d774d3d8193248750262a", "ja": "公開収録当日……", "zh": "公开录制当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "191974875f1cbc7ff7bae737c3eb3e871d8cb65df5b9905c0e4c9ade52e546b0", "ja": "と、いうわけで……。\nこの後は、お待ちかねのライブパートです。", "zh": "所以说……接下来就是大家期待已久的演唱会环节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1029_audience", "source_sha256": "edafcbce993c2062ba9b981b54f22be1911fe9b2fb88e83c12c1022ee66cede5", "ja": "ワァァァァァ……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "ae2cb42fde21362529a460457ab0f3462230075657a5c710758f85e8eec36898", "ja": "わたしたちの楽しい時間を、\nいっぱい詰め込んだ曲です♪", "zh": "这首歌里装满了\n我们度过的快乐时光♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "26197109e27c6220f01b3ffbe4b5344dfb38678efaff32ac425c5d209d895bd9", "ja": "ここにいるみんなと、いつも私たちのラジオを\n一緒に楽しんでくれるみんなに届けます！　せーのっ！", "zh": "献给在这里的大家，以及一直和我们一起享受广播的大家！预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "ec213c5d1bc71877e2417b141a4df11d405387308ad1fa5809bba58d7139a64f", "ja": "『U・N・M・E・I ライブ』！", "zh": "《U・N・M・E・I 演唱会》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "ec213c5d1bc71877e2417b141a4df11d405387308ad1fa5809bba58d7139a64f", "ja": "『U・N・M・E・I ライブ』！", "zh": "《U・N・M・E・I 演唱会》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "ec213c5d1bc71877e2417b141a4df11d405387308ad1fa5809bba58d7139a64f", "ja": "『U・N・M・E・I ライブ』！", "zh": "《U・N・M・E・I 演唱会》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1035_audience", "source_sha256": "edafcbce993c2062ba9b981b54f22be1911fe9b2fb88e83c12c1022ee66cede5", "ja": "ワァァァァァ……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1036_null", "source_sha256": "b3644b1facf25a509777a67354c7838662776737a2c00bb5a428238d73986383", "ja": "テキスト非表示", "zh": "隐藏文本", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "08d8b3255fe67a99dd6bc5e7bcc6724cbbc4b33f28f82566d864ef0be4269d68", "ja": "それじゃ、あらためて……みんな、お疲れさま！\n初めての公開収録イベントは大成功だったな！", "zh": "那么，重新来过……大家，辛苦了！\n第一次的公开录制活动大获成功啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "a7c58083cbf2b1ce3d2ea7e08f96839bd208e9d57f24f2a13cd067be924aafcc", "ja": "ほっとしました。劇場での公開収録は\n初めてだったから、ちょっと緊張しちゃって。", "zh": "我就放心了。因为这是第一次在剧场进行公开录制，所以刚才有点紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "bc6fd2eeb6e81757710788ad654fff5863ceb8c07fbbc991b5be48fd8f533ce9", "ja": "でもトークパートは、いつものおしゃべりみたいで……\nわたし、ずっと笑ってた気がします♪", "zh": "不过谈话环节就像平时聊天一样……我感觉自己一直都在笑呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "cbcf62b8a0107b1210d702521e83af709b9cc70ed54006c5e534a7d100055d6b", "ja": "私も！　笑いすぎてほっぺが痛いもん。\nでもリスナーさん達に会えて、うれしかったな～。", "zh": "我也是！笑得脸颊都疼了。不过能见到各位听众，真的好开心啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "ea5f8124b42ff19f321218771450cb09bbf467ce7bd54ea33023e4dc3fdbc839", "ja": "おたよりで知り合えた人たちが\nホントにいてくれて、会いに来てくれたんだーって！", "zh": "通过来信认识的那些人真的存在，还特地来见我们了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "22f1dd4bb0153ff8c30b7e288521b030202e822f891ffb994efd6608e41dfe48", "ja": "今回初めての公録ってことで、かなり遠くから\n来てくれたリスナーさん達もいたみたいだな。", "zh": "听说这次是第一次公开录音，还有听众从很远的地方赶来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "445a1d4e12769c53ccce0bfab0c6ea917e35f5c4f9f0fbdb177a60ebf0eadc6b", "ja": "きっとカプーラさんも来てくれてたと思うよ。", "zh": "我想卡普拉先生应该也来现场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "fd6f99149896f806647070162c1f33390aa5938c95e3050220c861977ac1d3c2", "ja": "中学生くらいの人、何人かいました。\nあの中の誰かだったのかな……。", "zh": "里面有几个看起来像是初中生的人。\n会不会就是其中的某一个呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "08f30a3d53dbbc0b634ab16a6778b53c12bd095f8e28be116f745614815eab1b", "ja": "わかんないけど、絶対来てくれてたと思うな。\nハガキにそう書いてあったし！", "zh": "虽然不清楚，但我觉得他绝对来过。\n明信片上就是这么写的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "c4a7717f1ad038aee8529826c605aafd3ec99d46315c6a765adb04277eb2174c", "ja": "でも、不思議ね。会ったことも話したこともなくて、\n顔も知らない人と、ラジオとおたよりで知り合って。", "zh": "不过，真不可思议。明明从没见过面，也没交谈过，\n却能通过广播和来信，和一个连长什么样都不知道的人相识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "6e534c7bda04bbecaee4c4961f5594878dab7ca20454e37b18af6231dd6aa581", "ja": "どんな人なのかをちょっとだけ知って……、\nそれだけで仲良くなれたって思えて。", "zh": "稍微了解了她是个什么样的人……  \n仅仅这样，就让我觉得我们已经成为朋友了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "19878831bbaab5aaddbcfc74e07ba784cdc2e97b114bcda465780374ee9c1848", "ja": "これって、すごいことだと思います！", "zh": "我觉得这是一件非常了不起的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "55468fd6566826e9487465e4b1fb2c17ef87de17e4fff617bbced76c3adf4578", "ja": "カプーラさんもだけど、カプーラさんだけじゃなくて、\nどこかにいる、たっくさんのリスナーさんたちも。", "zh": "不光是卡普拉先生，还有不只是卡普拉先生、而是身处各处的许许多多听众们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "0155507d682712d1720cecf41965ec29facd85d00c6fe54b2df8075bb267db3d", "ja": "みんなと私たちが出会えたことって、\n本当に、運命みたいな奇跡だと思います！", "zh": "能和大家相遇，\n真的就像命中注定的奇迹一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "f0fc7d2ef0184eebc47954eb45de6b52e4a4de8d4858d74f82173b62f31e3053", "ja": "出会ってくれてありがとうって気持ち……。\n今日のステージでちゃんと伝えられたかな。", "zh": "“谢谢你愿意与我相遇”的这份心情……\n今天在舞台上，有好好传达给大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "13753de126450d46d1c9fbd003cabfd2af32ac4229a8e39d434ae128de947049", "ja": "未来さん……。はい！", "zh": "未来姐姐……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "4c9dc2d3d63d0b853cacdc7f3049ed76d4dd6152d3ffe81bccea0f06727eaf45", "ja": "そうね。きっと……！", "zh": "是啊。一定会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "002c70fc0ff24a1c74cb24e890ef8fef5760f42e8018bafb77235f5358dc9345", "ja": "（未来、静香、星梨花。そしてもちろん、\nラジオを支えてるのは、それを聞いてくれる人達だ）", "zh": "（未来、静香、星梨花。当然，支撑着这档广播的，\n还有收听它的人们。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8cb8e259817e26b4b942d8559383a9bb59d242291548f73c6d954cca2984c70f", "ja": "（運命みたいな奇跡の出会いが、\nこれからもどんどん広がっていくといいな！）", "zh": "（如同命中注定般的奇迹相遇，希望今后也能不断扩展下去！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f8c6e38e6d89bed7c29e17cf44bd2a1dc0bfe670a7b641b57923ca062ff3cefa", "ja": "さてと。会議室にお菓子とジュースを用意したから、\n打ち上げといこうか。", "zh": "那么，我已经在会议室准备好了点心和果汁，接下来就来开庆功会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "ffa0ee6174cecd862c4c21bb1f26b6d29e19cbdd3d86f0e4eec5c7d6d0041563", "ja": "わーい、ご褒美スイーツ！　ありがとうございます♪\nじゃあ早速、パーティー会場に向かって～？", "zh": "哇—，是奖励的甜点！谢谢您♪\n那我们赶快，朝着派对会场～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "d959b19b6d5d988789c7bbd9e2192b0d534cc118ad9db0884c29e2423bf80443", "ja": "出発しんこー！です♪", "zh": "出发啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "00063207fd147dd786eb5eb36bebf37851ac5b79b51a25d76073e916d16eff6f", "ja": "ちなみに、打ち上げでの会話は録音して、\nCDのおまけにつける予定だから。よろしくな！", "zh": "顺便说一下，庆功宴上的谈话会录下来，预定作为CD的附赠内容。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "1bf7d35ff8485e412e0f03fecb7db8c111a1dc058bc702ab8168ce28f7341bb1", "ja": "えっ、またおまけにするんですか？\nもう、それじゃ全然気が休まらない……。", "zh": "诶，还要再把它做成特典吗？\n真是的，这样我完全没法放松……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0384_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0384_story_07_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "5b4e9b88aef484539f94aab906e3ae7177d536a5ce1cd9b68b956d8017cf7ad1", "ja": "大丈夫だよ静香ちゃん！　私たち、今日もステージで\nフツーにおしゃべり楽しめたし。ほら、いこいこっ！", "zh": "没事的啦，静香！我们今天在台上\n也能照常开开心心地聊天嘛。好啦，走吧走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
